# Kvantum recolor map: Monochrome (Patrik Wyde) -> Gorgoroth (Black Metal).
#
# Format: <old-hex> <new-hex>   # role
# Consumed by:
#   recolor.sh  -> applies the substitution to the theme SVG and kvconfig
#   verify.sh   -> fails if any non-identity old hex survives in a derived theme
#
# Rules:
#   - identity pairs (old == new) are never substituted and never flagged
#   - #ff00ff is a functional marker (Kvantum "menu-shadow-hint" elements) and
#     is never remapped
#   - two kvconfig keys are overridden by role in recolor.sh after this pass:
#       alt.base.color       = #2a2325  (alternate background)
#       highlight.text.color = #000000  (dark text on the teal highlight)
#
# Gorgoroth ladder: 000000 bg · 222222 button/selection · 2a2325 alternate
# 505050 dim · 888888/999999/aaaaaa mids · c1c1c1 foreground · 5f8787 teal
# accent · 9b8d7f visited · 8a4f4f negative · ddeecc bright.

141416 000000   # dark edges / shadows
1e1e20 000000   # window / base background
222222 222222   # identity: button and selection dark
22252e 222222   # breeze dark placeholder
232325 222222   # dark placeholder
28282a 222222   # dark placeholder
31363b 222222   # breeze dark placeholder
323234 2a2325   # mid-light border -> alternate warm dark
38383a 222222   # mid dark
414143 505050   # low mid gray -> dim
464648 505050   # light.color
48484a 505050
4b4b4d 505050
525254 505050
565658 505050
5a5a5c 505050   # inactive highlight / text
5c616c 505050   # breeze gray placeholder
606062 505050
646464 aaaaaa   # link (KDE scheme ForegroundLink)
646466 505050
6e6e70 888888
727274 5f8787   # highlight -> teal accent
78787a 888888
7a7a7c 888888
7f8c8d 9b8d7f   # visited link (KDE scheme ForegroundVisited)
88888a 888888
8c8c8e 999999
aaaaac c1c1c1   # text
c8c8ca c1c1c1
d2d2d4 c1c1c1
dadadc c1c1c1
ffffff c1c1c1   # brightest glyphs -> foreground
3daee9 5f8787   # breeze accent placeholder -> teal
da4453 8a4f4f   # negative red
000000 000000   # identity: pure black
ff00ff ff00ff   # identity: functional marker, do not remap
